<section class="fpg-fo-sec" id="features"><div class="fpg-fo-wrap"><h2 class="fpg-fo-h2">How the ST6P is built</h2><ul class="fpg-fo-feats" role="list">
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip6.jpg?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip6.jpg?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-grip6.jpg?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>FörstGrip feed rollers</h3><p>Twin hydraulic rollers. The top one lifts on an arc and is held down by two heavy springs, so it climbs over butt ends and drags in forks and awkward limbs.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly6.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly6.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-fly6.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Open-top flywheel</h3><p>A 640 × 25 mm flywheel with twin 8-inch blades throws the chip instead of blowing it, so wet, green material is far less likely to block the chute.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-vtwin.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-vtwin.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-vtwin.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>40hp V-twin petrol</h3><p>A Briggs &amp; Stratton Vanguard with electronic fuel injection: fuel on demand, and a three-year engine warranty.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-under750.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-under750.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-under750.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Under 750 kg</h3><p>GRP panels and the light V-twin keep it to 745 kg, on a C-section chassis with extra steel where the stress is.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-auto.jpg?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>AutoIntelligence control</h3><p>Sealed electronics that run the no-stress feed, tell you when a service is due and prompt the routine checks. Proof against water and vibration.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-touch6.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-touch6.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-touch6.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Touch-button feed</h3><p>Separate feed and reverse buttons beside the hopper, sealed against water and vibration.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-speed.jpg?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-speed.jpg?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-speed.jpg?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Variable roller speed</h3><p>Slow the feed for hardwood, speed it up for brash.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-anvil.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Easy-access anvil</h3><p>The anvil turns or swaps in minutes, so a fresh edge is never a workshop job.</p></div></li>
<li class="fpg-fo-feat"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tank30.webp?width=768" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tank30.webp?width=400 400w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0734/1477/0982/files/fpgf-feat-tank30.webp?width=768 768w" sizes="(min-width: 990px) 30vw, (min-width: 600px) 46vw, 92vw" alt="" width="768" height="576" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><div><h3>Clear fuel tank</h3><p>A see-through 30-litre tank with a wide filler neck. You can read the level from across the yard.</p></div></li>
</ul></div></section>
